00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:29.640
Oh, it's controlling the sound with the 
design of the frame and the unit's material.

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:34.760
Repairing the circuit inside won't 
be enough to restore the sound.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.980
Ah, they're out of production!

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:45.880
I guess I'll just have to do it myself.

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:20.820
I'm sorry.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.560
I won't be able to fix things anymore.

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:29.730
I want to spend my time on 
the things I want to build.

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:33.230
I see. I'm glad to hear it.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:40.990
<i>Why was he smiling when I turned him down?</i>

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:43.490
Oh, sorry to keep relying 
on you, Mikogami.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:47.480
It's fine. Just, about this handycam...

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:50.610
And, well, not only that...

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:53.290
I won't be able to help you 
with the repairs anymore.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.580
Really?

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:54.980
Huh?

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.500
Well, thanks for your help thus far.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:01.380
Still, she's a talented girl, 
fixing everything like that.

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:03.590
Yes, she is.

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:13.370
<i>Was he doing all of that for my sake?</i>

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:33.540
Good. You're awake now?

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.930
Tsukasa?

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:45.740
Wh-Wh-Why was I sleeping on your lap?!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.530
Oh, it's already evening.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:59.230
What's the matter, Ringo?

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:05.780
<i>Falling asleep? I'm such 
a failure, it's laughable.</i>

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:09.080
None of it matters anymore.

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:11.080
Huh? What do you mean?

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:16.470
I had a dream just now, a happy one.

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:19.130
<i>A happy dream.</i>

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:24.150
<i>There were hardships too, 
but I managed to meet Tsukasa.</i>

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.970
<i>I'm a lucky girl.</i>

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:30.140
<i>I might have messed up this date,</i>

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:31.720
<i>but I can just have another one.</i>

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:35.600
<i>After all, I've already found 
someone I can love this much,</i>

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.280
<i>and he's already this close to me.</i>

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:40.860
Ringo?

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:44.940
Hey, um...

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:46.040
What is it?

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:49.320
C-Can we take a picture together?

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:53.080
Yeah, sure. Let's take one.

00:22:03.350 --> 00:22:05.210
I'll cherish this.

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:07.970
Can you send it to me later?

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:09.020
Sure.

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:19.130
Tsukasa, thank you 
for asking me out today.

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:21.000
I had a lot of fun.

00:22:21.810 --> 00:22:23.770
Yeah, so did I.

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:26.820
It was a very worthwhile day off.

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:29.900
What a nice city.

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:33.690
All the more reason we need to protect it.

00:22:33.690 --> 00:22:36.730
Our seeds of democracy have 
finally begun to sprout.

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:40.080
Ringo,

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:43.400
there's something I need you to do.

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:44.340
Huh?

00:22:48.810 --> 00:22:52.120
It's something only you can do.

00:22:53.540 --> 00:22:56.090
Tsukasa?

00:22:58.830 --> 00:22:59.940
Tell me.

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:11.490
<i>Welcome back, bear!</i>

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:16.120
<i>How did your date go, bear?</i>

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:17.870
It was very fun.

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:21.360
<i>Oh! You both look very cute!</i>

00:23:21.360 --> 00:23:23.450
<i>It's like you're already a couple, bear!</i>

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:25.960
<i>Looks like spring has finally 
arrived for you too, bear!</i>

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:27.150
<i>Go, go, bear!</i>

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:27.880
Bearabbit.

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:30.760
<i>Hm? Ringo, what's the matter, bear?</i>

00:23:30.760 --> 00:23:35.160
Tomorrow, we start working 
on our biggest project yet,

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:38.150
so prepare yourself.
